gs":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#three-tools-do-not-mix-them-up","content":"Never offered: `docker system prune -a --volumes`. That would eat other stacks' volumes."},"202":{"id":"/disk-wizard-38","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Survey** (always read-only) — `df`, Docker `system df` when available, catalog matches, top files under allowed roots."},"203":{"id":"/disk-wizard-39","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Explain + rank** — largest *likely leftover* first. Each row: what / why / risk / reclaim / whether something is running."},"204":{"id":"/disk-wizard-40","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Guide in three steps**"},"205":{"id":"/disk-wizard-41","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**A — Safe junk** — `*.incomplete`, dangling Comfy symlinks, unused Docker **build cache**, detached HF revisions, core dumps. Default accept on `--apply`."},"206":{"id":"/disk-wizard-42","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**B — Review leftovers** — unused named images, HF hub repos that are not the lab keep-set, Ollama blobs, opt-in Comfy packs, large MP4s under `COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR`. Default **skip**. Set `DISK_WIZARD_STEP_B=1` to quarantine those when applying."},"207":{"id":"/disk-wizard-43","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**C — Will