es **privately** via GitHub Security Advisories on this repository (or the maintainer contact listed on the GitHub profile). **Do not** open public issues for exploitable flaws."},"2075":{"id":"/contribute/security-17","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#scope-notes-from-the-root-file","content":"This project is a **lab/demo** stack for controlled DGX Spark environments."},"2076":{"id":"/contribute/security-18","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#scope-notes-from-the-root-file","content":"**Do not expose ComfyUI (port 8188) to the public internet** without authentication / network policy."},"2077":{"id":"/contribute/security-19","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#scope-notes-from-the-root-file","content":"Never commit `HF_TOKEN`, `.env`, or host secrets."},"2078":{"id":"/contribute/security-20","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#scope-notes-from-the-root-file","content":"`download-limit` uses `sudo` for wondershaper — review sudoers policy on shared hosts."},"2079":{"id":"/contribute/security-21","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#scope-notes-from-the-root-file","content":"studio-ui (`${STUDIO_UI_PORT:-8190}`) is an optional jobstore board, also not a public product: studio-ui."},"2080":{"id":"/contribute/security-22","page_id":"/contribute/security","tags":["security","safety","comfyui","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/security#operational-safety","content":"Resource exhaustion can be as bad as a software CVE when the host is remote-only:"},"2081":{"id":"/contribute/security-23","page_id":"