ate/music-edm-15","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#drive-through-edm","content":"Do **not** load Klein + Wan + LTX + ACE-Step in one session. Cover art is a later Klein session. Files land under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}`."},"2409":{"id":"/create/music-edm-16","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#180s-drive-through-edm-examples","content":"Eighty-five extra full-track graphs under &#x2A;*`_lab/audio/albums/drive-through/<album>/`**. Same AIO, sampler, occupancy **audio**. App &#x2A;*Duration (seconds)** defaults to **180**. Queue a numbered track **on its own**, or `album-render --album drive-through/<album-slug>`. SaveAudi&#x6F; stem is &#x2A;*`NN - Song Title`**."},"2410":{"id":"/create/music-edm-17","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#180s-drive-through-edm-examples","content":"Fictional act only: **Drive-through** (hardcore, pure of heart) playing a **live bass DJ set**. Original **warped hybrid-trap EDM** spliced from Audio Rack catalogs (hybrid trap, riddim, tearout, brostep, wave bass, color bass, drumstep, dirty dubstep, neuro bass, chest/dirty bass, festival trap — not techno, not big room, not progressive house). Named recipes (`rec_drive_through_drop`, `rec_drive_riddim`, …) fill empty axes; each take overrides tempo and bass. No living-DJ names. No famous-hook paraphrases. Eighty-three takes lock `instrumental, no vocals, no singing, no choir, no vocal chops` via `mix_drive_lock` (App **Vocal / instrumental** = instrumental; encoder language `unknown`). Two takes are sparse DJ-shout treats (`wide open`, `second wave`): App mode **vocal**, `voc_dj_shout`, one 1–2 word `[chorus]` chop, no `[verse]`. Arrangement scores are empty-body ACE markers (`[drop - warped bass, rapid hi-hats]`, `[inst - …]`, `[outro]`) so ACE does not sing production notes — drop first, hard warpy drops, trap drums, chest-sub / 808, no quiet dips, unique flow per take — not a Nill Bye verse/chorus loop and not a melody-drop-break-drop skeleton. Cover **LoadImage** stays unwired; App **Album art** defaults to skip. Some takes add dual-action pedal bass under rolling hats. Phase2, phase3, and phase4 graphs keep that ACE topology but vary Comfy node placement across five layouts (`column`, `wide-stage`, `stacked-tower`, `prompt-left`, `output-rail`). ACE-Step timbre is invented. Human selection and edit required before any release."},"2411":{"id":"/create/music-edm-18","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#180s-drive-through-edm-examples","content":"This is **not** the Nill Bye trap/EDM pack. Those graphs are rap **over** club beds with a dry booth. Drive-through is dance EDM (mostly instrumental)."},"2412":{"id":"/create/music-edm-19","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#180s-drive-through-edm-examples","content":"Catalog order is the recommended live-set queue (each graph still Queues alone)."},"2413":{"id":"/create/music-edm-20","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#hour-1-audioalbumsdrive-throughhour-1","content":"Hour 1 of the live bass set. Full album: `./scripts/manage.sh album-render --album drive-through/hour-1`."},"2414":{"id":"/create/music-edm-21","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#hour-1-audioalbumsdrive-throughhour-1","content":"Graph"},"2415":{"id":"/create/music-edm-22","page_id":"/create/music-edm","tags":["music","edm","ace-step","drive-through","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-edm#hou