nt":"`./scripts/manage.sh shot-sheet run --film go-see` writes `films/gosee/shots.yaml`. Does not overwrite lab YAML."},"3241":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-21","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Optional board: **stills/identity-sheet** then **stills/storyboard-6up** (seed 42, 1280×704)."},"3242":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-22","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Optional clay: `manage.sh stop` then `export-guides --film go-see --shot 12`. Workbench clay + depth + canny, not Cycles beauty. Path D: dump on the laptop, rsync `guides/`. Creator plates (not 5.00s): `blender-stills` then **klein-from-clay-plates** — Blender creator suite."},"3243":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-23","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"`manage.sh film-animatic --film go-see` — clay.mp4 or 5.00 s still holds, cap 90 s. Compose may stay up."},"3244":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-24","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Start Comfy. Queue **dcc/clay-hero** on `first.png`, or stay on `:8188` with **dcc/guide-still** (Stay in Comfy after a Blender dump). Then `overlay-qc --film go-see --shot 12 --look PATH`. Iterate the look, not the print."},"3245":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-25","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Stop Klein. `download-ltx --tier iclora` if needed. Queue **dcc/depth-control-12s** or Templates → LTX-2.5 Union Control (depth from `depth.mp4`). MagCache off. Distilled-only. Refuse 19B Union."},"3246":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-26","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Stop LTX. Occupancy **audio**. `stem-mix --film go-see --shot 12 --bg PATH` (optional `--dx`). Duck −15 dB, YouTube loudnorm I=-14. App: **audio/stem-mix**."},"3247":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-27","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"`film-accept` then concat. Disclosure sidecar stays."},"3248":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-28","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Printers stay **5.00 s / 1280×704 / 121 frames (`1+8n`) @ 24 fps**. Do not type a 90 s latent. Do not type 120 (VAE floors to 113 frames)."},"3249":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-29","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"If"},"3250":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-30","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"Skip"},"3251":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-31","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"No Blender / Path D not ready"},"3252":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-32","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"Film clay dump. Look plate owns composition. Overlay QC is skipped, not faked. Instagram clay tour still Queues on `start` / `--seed-inputs` layout plates; language-only → **stills/dream-house**."},"3253":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-33","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"Empty dialogue"},"3254":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-34","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"DX stem"},"3255":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-35","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"Shorts “world SFX, no score”"},"3256":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-36","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"MX. Do not load ACE-Step next to LTX."},"3257":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-37","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"Talking-head / VO-locked picture"},"3258":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-38","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#skip-rules","content":"Union Control. Use A2V freeze (`motion/av/audio-to-video-12s`). Mouths will not match."},"3259":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-39","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#occupancy","content":"One GB10 job. `export-guides` and `house-views` die if compose is up (exit 2). `overlay-qc`, `film-animatic`, and `stem-mix` are host ffmpeg and **may** run while Comfy is up. Stop the visual session before ACE-Step."},"3260":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-40","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#occupancy","content":"Instagram stills of one place (not a 5.00s print): Dream-house tours. That dump is 1024×1280, not the LTX 1280×704 pack."},"3261":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-41","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#occupancy","content":"Safety is unchanged: `restart: \"no\"`, type **yes** on start, headroom, download-limit clear-on-exit."},"3262":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-42","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#occupancy","content":"Playbook details: DCC guide pack. Shot YAML: 90s shorts. Apps: ComfyUI Apps."},"3263":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","type":"page","content":"Stay in Comfy after a Blender dump","breadcrumbs":["Docs","How the studio works"],"tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender"},"3264":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-0","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","content":"Load a host Blender guide pack on the Comfy canvas, Klein-look a plate, gate occupancy, and hand off to LTX or TRELLIS without leaving :8188."},"3265":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-1","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","type":"heading","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#stay-in-comfy-after-a-blender-dump","content":"Stay in Comfy after a Blender dump"},"3266":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-2","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","type":"heading","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#operator-loop","con