le US-safe local studio**: ComfyUI in Docker on **one** NVIDIA DGX Spark, with Apache Klein 4B stills, Apache Wan 2.2 silent motion, and LTX-2.5 joint AV."},"3542":{"id":"/learn-16","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"It is **not** nvidia-dgx-spark-lab (no K3s, no dashboard, no multi-node NCCL). How the pieces fit: Architecture. When to graduate: When to use vs spark-lab."},"3543":{"id":"/learn-17","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"SSH to the Spark. Run `./scripts/manage.sh` for setup, doctor, downloads, start (type **yes**), and stop."},"3544":{"id":"/learn-18","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"Getting Started"},"3545":{"id":"/learn-19","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"Browser at port **8188**. Load a `_lab` graph, change widgets, Queue, pick PNG/MP4 from `COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR`."},"3546":{"id":"/learn-20","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"ComfyUI basics"},"3547":{"id":"/learn-21","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"Local weights only. Klein + Wan are Apache; LTX is Community License (gated, $10M cap). MiniMax H3 is banned."},"3548":{"id":"/learn-22","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"Model licenses"},"3549":{"id":"/learn-23","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"Dotted terms open a definition dialog. This Learn section teaches the ideas behind those words."},"3550":{"id":"/learn-24","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#the-one-sentence-version","content":"Glossary"},"3551":{"id":"/learn-25","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#two-jobs-one-machine","content":"You can be both people. First-time path is still operator-shaped (clone, doctor, download, start), then you become a studio user for the first still."},"3552":{"id":"/learn-26","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#what-you-make","content":"Text → **still** (Klein) → **silent \\~5 s** (Wan) → **AV \\~5 s** (LTX). Iterate in minutes. A 90 s YouTube short is **18 × 5 s** prints stitched, not one 90 s denoise."},"3553":{"id":"/learn-27","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#what-you-make","content":"Learn the models: Klein, Wan, and LTX. Learn the math-lite version of latents and steps: Image and video generation. Learn why SSH-safe defaults exist: Hardware, memory, and safety."},"3554":{"id":"/learn-28","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#suggested-order","content":"This page (you are here)"},"3555":{"id":"/learn-29","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#suggested-order","content":"Architecture — Compose, three stores, occupancy XOR"},"3556":{"id":"/learn-30","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","dgx-spark","concepts"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#suggested-order","content":"When to use vs spark-lab — this sample vs the full lab"},"3557":{"id":"/learn-31","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","comfyui","studio","